### ==========================================
### 准备工作：登录，获取并保存 Cookie
### ==========================================

### 登录 admin (执行后，IDEA 会自动在下方保存 Cookie)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{host}}/api/v1/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin1"
}

> {%
    // 提取 Set-Cookie 并保存为全局变量
    client.global.set("admin_cookie", response.headers.valueOf("Set-Cookie"));
%}


### ==========================================
### 测试场景 1：自己读改
### ==========================================

### 1.1 读取自己的项目 (预期: 200, 四字段)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}
Cookie: {{admin_cookie}}

### 1.2 修改自己的项目 (预期: 200)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}
Cookie: {{admin_cookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "修改后的名字",
  "description": "修改后的描述"
}

### 1.3 再次读取，验证新值 (预期: 200, 能看到修改后的值)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}
Cookie: {{admin_cookie}}


### ==========================================
### 测试场景 3：不存在的编号 & 非法编号
### ==========================================

### 3.1 获取不存在的正整数编号 (预期: 业务码 5004)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/projects/999999
Cookie: {{admin_cookie}}

### 3.2 非法编号 id <= 0 (预期: 业务码 VALIDATE_ERROR)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/projects/0
Cookie: {{admin_cookie}}

### 3.3 非数字路径 (预期: 报错，不会成功)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/projects/abc
Cookie: {{admin_cookie}}


### ==========================================
### 测试场景 4：未登录访问
### ==========================================

### 4.1 未登录 GET (预期: HTTP 401, 业务码 4000)
# 注意：这里故意不写 Cookie
GET {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}

### 4.2 未登录 PUT (预期: HTTP 401, 业务码 4000)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "hacker",
  "description": "未登录"
}


### ==========================================
### 测试场景 5：参数校验
### ==========================================

### 5.1 空白名称 (预期: 拒绝)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}
Cookie: {{admin_cookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "   ",
  "description": "测试空白名称"
}

### 5.2 101 长度名称 (预期: 拒绝)
# 需要你手动填入 101 个 a
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}
Cookie: {{admin_cookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "这里替换为101个a",
  "description": "超长"
}

### 5.3 501 长度描述 (预期: 拒绝)
# 需要你手动填入 501 个字符
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}
Cookie: {{admin_cookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "正常",
  "description": "这里替换为501个字符"
}

### 5.4 合法的 100 长度边界名称 (预期: 成功)
# 手动填入正好 100 个 a
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}
Cookie: {{admin_cookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "这里替换为100个a",
  "description": "正好100"
}


### ==========================================
### 测试场景 6：null 清空、非法字段塞入
### ==========================================

### 6.1 null 清空描述 (预期: 成功，GET 后为 null)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}
Cookie: {{admin_cookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "测试清空描述",
  "description": null
}

### 6.2 塞入 ownerId、id、createTime (预期: 成功，但归属和时间不变)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}
Cookie: {{admin_cookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "测试非法字段",
  "description": "企图篡改",
  "ownerId": 999,
  "id": 888,
  "createTime": "2020-01-01T00:00:00"
}

### 6.3 再次读取看是否篡改 (预期: ownerId 还是你的，createTime 还是原来的)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}
Cookie: {{admin_cookie}}
//projectService的业务逻辑尚未修改，暂无法进行测试